OL,3,GNEWSASenior judge to review trial of
OL,4,Athe facts framework after Donaldson
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former senior judge will carry out a
OL,8,Freview of the legal framework on trial
OL,9,Fof the facts cases in Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fin the wake of the Donaldson trial.
OL,12,FEleanor Donaldson, wife of convicted
OL,13,Fsex offender Jeffrey Donaldson, had
OL,14,Ffaced a trial of the facts after being
OL,15,Ffound unfit for a conventional trial on
OL,16,Fmental health grounds.
OL,18,FSir John Gillen, who led a major review
OL,19,Fof sexual offence trials in 2019, is
OL,20,Fexpected to deliver an interim report
OL,21,Fby February 2027, with a final report
OL,22,Fdue in spring 2027.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
