OL,3,GNEWSASenior judge to review trial of
OL,4,Athe facts framework after Donaldson
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department of Justice said the
OL,8,Freview would examine a range of
OL,9,Ffactors, including whether a
OL,10,Fconventional criminal trial should
OL,11,Fremain possible if an individual
OL,12,Fbecomes fit to plead.
